# Operator-specific private-infra tokens for `just check-leaks`.
#
# Copy this file to .leak-tokens (which is gitignored) and list the tokens that
# must never appear in a tracked file: internal host aliases, personal handles
# or emails, or any other private operational string. One POSIX extended-regex
# per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# `just check-leaks` always enforces a built-in baseline that matches the
# common private prefixes 192.168.x and 10.0.0.x. Add any other private ranges
# you actually use (for example 10.x, 172.16-31.x, 169.254.x) and your host
# aliases or handles below, so the baseline does not have to guess them.
#
# Examples (placeholders; replace with your own and delete these lines):
# my-archive-host
# my-proxmox-node
# firstname\.lastname
